                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This whole thing is about someone getting their heart broken and instead of getting over it/working on themselves or literally anything else that should be done in a healthy manner, the person turns to their pets and goes \"THEY WILL LOVE ME INSTEAD!!!!!!!!\"\n\nThat's right.  All of these pets...  The ones that people think of as their \"children\" or \"little joys in life\"/\"fluffballs\"...  Are all now rebounds.  Unhealthy...  Sick and full of what the fawkery.\n\nAs per usual, the psychology is completely off in this book.  They let criminals go and even serve them tea.  They go as far as \"oh I was in love with this guy, so I set you two up together, so he can notice me!\"  .....  To that I exclaim: \"Girl, YOU STUPID!!!\"\n\nThe MC is a cutout of nothing.  It's just running away, waterworks and incoherent mumbling.  If she didn't exist, the air would do a better job filling in.  Oh and she loves when she is preyed upon and taken advantage of.  She just lays there and takes it and says \"my heart is so full!\"\n\nThe Love Interests:\n\nThe Pets who were JUST PETS are suddenly human and do everything and solve everything for the MC.  How...?  Also, their \"reason\" for transforming?  Please tell me what pet in reality goes around \"oh I love my owner, so turn me human cos I wanna BANG THEM!!!\"  Aha...\n\nAlso, you learn spick of nothing about anyone, so enjoy!\n\nOkay so...  (MC falls for all of these rebounds within 1-3 days.  Guess her \"being with the ex for over a year and loving him\" was a true, solid relationship.)\n\n - The Ex-Boyfriend ->  Is a piece of work.  He just sucks and his Route blows.  You get a bigger picture to the \"mystery and even dumber \"\"\"\"\"VILLAIN'S\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\" motives\"......  Apart from that he is labeled the \"only human you can date\".  Delightful.\n\n- The Rabbit: A disgusting, vile, evil piece of work.  He is manipulative in every Route and if MC doesn't love him, he just decided to off himself.  Then he claims he \"loves his family\", and then go on to ensure everyone is gone just so he can be a rebound for sloppy seconds.  Cool.\n\n - The Pig: Rebound.  Supposedly kind and then he does \"certain things to her\" -> Which she completely let's happen.  She approves of it all and loves him.\n\n - The Parrot: Uhhhhhhhh.............  Absolutely nothing significant happens.\n\n - The Cat:  Has 5 great lines across all Routes/Including his own.  That's it.\n\n\nI need to also mention that the story itself has no action in it.  The most action that happens is this:  MC cries and runs off and her vision goes dark and she falls to the floor.\n\nIf you enjoy that...  What is WRONG WITH YOU?!\n\nNah nevermind, it's not you.\n\nThere are no animal powers used.  There is nothing good being done.  Everyone is sheet and f-ed up.  Nothing is worthy of anything is in here and it's just some sad girl's tale of a broken heart and her wish that her pets would be her rebound.\n\nLOL.  I am not even sure to laugh or cry...  I am just numb at this point.",
